{
  "name": "HL · Refund agent (4.5)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Refund agent with a human gate\nLesson 4.5. Five layers between a message and your money:\n① input checks (mask card numbers, then a jailbreak classifier) ② least-privilege tools: get_order, search_policies, issue_refund only ③ output check on the reply ④ Tolu approves every refund (inside SUB · Issue refund) ⑤ Decisions log.\n\n**Credentials:** Telegram API; OpenAI; Supabase; Google Sheets OAuth2.\n**Replace:** YOUR_MODEL (3 model nodes); YOUR_GET_ORDER_WORKFLOW_ID; YOUR_ISSUE_REFUND_WORKFLOW_ID; YOUR_SHEET_ID (Log decision).\nDecisions columns for this log: time, chat_id, message, guardrail, reply, output_check, tools_used.\n\nThe lesson uses n8n's Guardrails node; this template uses a Code node (PII masking) plus a Text Classifier (jailbreak) before the agent, and a Text Classifier after it, so it imports on any version. Swap in Guardrails if yours has it.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "dbdcb353-1934-4e54-97ca-654e58215332",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "77d46296-b64f-43b7-88b9-eac9c7af58b6",
